      "suggested_fix": "Include EIP-712 domain separation in the digest calculation. Add chainId and contract address to the digest: bytes32 domainSeparator = keccak256(abi.encode(block.chainid, address(this), ...)); Then include this domain separator in the main digest calculation."
    }
  ],
  "overall_explanation": "The contract implements a Uniswap V4 hook that validates signed quotes for swaps. However, the signature verification mechanism is vulnerable to cross-chain replay attacks due to missing domain separation. The digest calculation excludes chain-specific identifiers, making signatures valid across different blockchain deployments of the same contract."
